Package: lazyGas
Type: Package
Title: Lazies' genetic association study (lazyGas): genetic association study pipeline for lazy guys
Version: 0.9.0
Date: 2026-07-09
Authors@R: person("Tomoyuki", "Furuta", 
           email = "f.tomoyuki@okayama-u.ac.jp",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0869-6626"))
Description: Genetic association study pipeline with companion Parquet storage,
  peak calling, candidate gene listing, variant viewer, interactive HTML reports,
  and a phenotype explorer Shiny app with GWAS / locus plots and optional local
  LLM support. GWAS effect coefficients for continuous traits are reported in
  original phenotype units.
License: GPL-3 + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
